      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.209,
          "end": 3.32,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmuller] So now we know how to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.32,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "output data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 6.29,
          "en": "In modern web applications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.29,
          "end": 8.56,
          "en": "that's only half of what you do though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.56,
          "end": 11.02,
          "en": "You also need to react to user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.02,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "You need to react to events.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 15.26,
          "en": "You wanna make dynamic pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 15.26,
          "end": 18.29,
          "en": "After all, this is one of the main reasons for using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.29,
          "end": 19.76,
          "en": "a framework like Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.76,
          "end": 22.81,
          "en": "It makes building highly reactive and dynamic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.81,
          "end": 24.743,
          "en": "web applications easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.7,
          "end": 28.47,
          "en": "Therefore, that's what we're going to focus on next,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.47,
          "end": 31.22,
          "en": "and attached you'll find a simple starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 31.22,
          "end": 34.04,
          "en": "which is not too different from the one before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 34.04,
          "end": 36.73,
          "en": "We just have a slightly different content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 36.73,
          "end": 39.35,
          "en": "Still got a section with a different ID now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 39.35,
          "end": 43.51,
          "en": "and in there we've got two buttons, add and remove.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.51,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "We also have a paragraph, where I output a counter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 49.29,
          "en": "which is managed in his Vue app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 51.94,
          "en": "which is created for you already.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.94,
          "end": 55.02,
          "en": "It's a very simple Vue app here, as you can tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.02,
          "end": 57.5,
          "en": "pretty empty, just has to state a method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.5,
          "end": 59.26,
          "en": "where I returned my data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.26,
          "end": 61.57,
          "en": "which only consists of a counter in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 61.57,
          "end": 63.48,
          "en": "which is a number, starting at zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 63.48,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "And then mount this to the events section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 70.49,
          "en": "which is this section that holds all that markup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 70.49,
          "end": 72.81,
          "en": "Now at the moment, those buttons don't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 72.81,
          "end": 76.21000000000001,
          "en": "If I press them, you'll see that well, nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 76.21000000000001,
          "end": 78.61,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we wanna work on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 78.61,
          "end": 81.4,
          "en": "I wanna show you how you can react to user input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 81.4,
          "end": 84.52,
          "en": "and how you now can really leverage Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 84.52,
          "end": 88.94,
          "en": "to make a more interactive and reactive web application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 88.94,
          "end": 91.67,
          "en": "Let's say, when this button, the add button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.67,
          "end": 93.22,
          "en": "when this button is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 93.22,
          "end": 95.937,
          "en": "we wanna add one, to the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 95.937,
          "end": 100.03999999999999,
          "en": "And the remove button, or reduce maybe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 100.03999999999999,
          "end": 102.03999999999999,
          "en": "When the reduce button, is pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 102.03999999999999,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "we wanna deduct one from the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 105.72,
          "end": 108.65,
          "en": "Let's start with the add button, how could we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 108.65,
          "end": 111.05,
          "en": "In regular JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 111.05,
          "end": 115.71000000000001,
          "en": "we would get access to the button with document,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.71000000000001,
          "end": 117.1,
          "en": "get element by ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 117.1,
          "end": 120.71,
          "en": "If that button had an ID or with query selector,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 120.71,
          "end": 123.19,
          "en": "and selecting the first button we find,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.19,
          "end": 125.08,
          "en": "and we could add an EventListener,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 125.08,
          "end": 127.07,
          "en": "with the addEventListener method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 127.07,
          "end": 129.43,
          "en": "That is how we would do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 129.43,
          "end": 133.14,
          "en": "in the vanilla JavaScript, without Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 133.14,
          "end": 134.41,
          "en": "But we're using Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 134.41,
          "end": 136.53,
          "en": "so that we don't have to do it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 136.53,
          "end": 140.31,
          "en": "so that we don't have to, define step by step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 140.31,
          "end": 143.37,
          "en": "what should happen, but that we instead can leverage,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 146.85,
          "en": "this declarative approach, and just declare,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 146.85,
          "end": 151.11,
          "en": "our end result and let Vue figure out how to get there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.11,
          "end": 152.81,
          "en": "And therefore, thankfully,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 152.81,
          "end": 156.45499999999998,
          "en": "Vue gives us an easier way of adding EventListeners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 156.45499999999998,
          "end": 158.72,
          "en": "to HTML elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 158.72,
          "end": 161.73,
          "en": "If we wanna add a click listener to this button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 161.73,
          "end": 164.66,
          "en": "we can use a never Vue directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.66,
          "end": 166.54,
          "en": "We learned about V-bind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 166.54,
          "end": 171.25,
          "en": "V-bind is helpful for setting the value of an attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.25,
          "end": 172.99,
          "en": "Now for adding EventListeners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 172.99,
          "end": 176.72,
          "en": "we have another directive, and that's the V-on directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 176.72,
          "end": 180.003,
          "en": "because we wanna react on, a certain event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 180.91,
          "end": 185.42,
          "en": "V-on takes a so-called argument, after a colon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 185.42,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "just like V-bind, took the attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 190.33,
          "en": "which should be bound.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.33,
          "end": 193.39,
          "en": "V-on takes the event to which you wanna listen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 193.39,
          "end": 194.73,
          "en": "after the colon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 196.023,
          "en": "In this case, click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 200.12,
          "en": "Now in case you're wondering to which events you can listen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.12,
          "end": 202.95,
          "en": "Well, all the default events you can listen to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.95,
          "end": 205.01,
          "en": "on HTML elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 205.01,
          "end": 209.67000000000002,
          "en": "So that would be click, mouseenter, mouseleave,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 209.67000000000002,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "really anything you can listen to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 213.57,
          "en": "in vanilla JavaScript as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 213.57,
          "end": 216.21,
          "en": "Here, it's the click to which I wanna listen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 216.21,
          "end": 218.17000000000002,
          "en": "And then after an equal sign,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 218.17000000000002,
          "end": 220.9,
          "en": "between the opening and closing double quotes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 220.9,
          "end": 223.66,
          "en": "we now specify the code that should run,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 223.66,
          "end": 225.21,
          "en": "when the click occurs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 225.21,
          "end": 227.57999999999998,
          "en": "And that could be counter plus, plus,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 227.57999999999998,
          "end": 230.56,
          "en": "which is the shortest form of writing and JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 230.56,
          "end": 233.09,
          "en": "that we wanna to add one, to the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 233.09,
          "end": 237.52,
          "en": "And that's just JavaScript code, nothing Vue specific.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 237.52,
          "end": 240.66,
          "en": "As with V-bind at the double curly braces,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 240.66,
          "end": 243.149,
          "en": "you can have simple JavaScript expressions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 243.149,
          "end": 246.32,
          "en": "right here in your HTML code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 246.32,
          "end": 248.92,
          "en": "in the parts that are managed by Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 248.92,
          "end": 251.17,
          "en": "Like here with V-on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 251.17,
          "end": 254.31,
          "en": "If I now save that in reload, I can click add,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 254.31,
          "end": 257.27,
          "en": "and you will see that the counter, gets bigger,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 257.27,
          "end": 260.91,
          "en": "every time I clicked this button, thanks to this code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 260.91,
          "end": 263.41,
          "en": "Now try doing, well, basically the same,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 263.41,
          "end": 266.693,
          "en": "just with reducing the counter, on this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 268.52,
          "end": 269.86,
          "en": "Were you successful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 269.86,
          "end": 271.93,
          "en": "Well, of course it shouldn't be too difficult,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 271.93,
          "end": 273.67,
          "en": "it's essentially the same code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 273.67,
          "end": 277.14,
          "en": "We wanna react to a click event, with V-on click.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 277.14,
          "end": 281.01,
          "en": "And then here, we just have counter minus, minus,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 281.01,
          "end": 284.14,
          "en": "or the longer form would also work of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 284.14,
          "end": 286.14,
          "en": "It's totally up to you, what you write there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 286.14,
          "end": 288.44,
          "en": "With that you can also reduce the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 288.44,
          "end": 291.07,
          "en": "So now we can add, and reduce.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 291.07,
          "end": 293.31,
          "en": "And that's pretty, pretty nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 293.31,
          "end": 298.05,
          "en": "And this is, how we can listen to user events in Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 298.05,
          "end": 300.07,
          "en": "And here's one super important thing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 300.07,
          "end": 301.49,
          "en": "which is easy to overlook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 301.49,
          "end": 306.49,
          "en": "which shows us why, we use Vue, and how powerful Vue is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 307.89,
          "end": 310.83,
          "en": "You might notice that we don't have much code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 310.83,
          "end": 315.6,
          "en": "some HTML code, and definitely not a lot of JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 315.6,
          "end": 319.86,
          "en": "I mean, this here is all the JavaScript code we wrote.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 319.86,
          "end": 323.71,
          "en": "Yet, we have two EventListeners, and a counter that changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 323.71,
          "end": 327.2,
          "en": "and most importantly, and easy to overlook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 327.2,
          "end": 329.62,
          "en": "we got a counter that's being output here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 329.62,
          "end": 332.89,
          "en": "where the page the users sees,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 332.89,
          "end": 335.7,
          "en": "changes every time the counter changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 335.7,
          "end": 339.15,
          "en": "This minus six here, changes to a minus five,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 339.15,
          "end": 340.37,
          "en": "if I click the button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 340.37,
          "end": 343.81,
          "en": "and that's not something which would normally happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 343.81,
          "end": 344.74,
          "en": "in a webpage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 344.74,
          "end": 347.65999999999997,
          "en": "You would need to write JavaScript code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 347.65999999999997,
          "end": 350.79,
          "en": "that adds EventListeners, changes the counter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 350.79,
          "end": 352.93,
          "en": "And then when the counter changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 352.93,
          "end": 355.12,
          "en": "reaches out to that paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 355.12,
          "end": 358.11,
          "en": "to change the value that's showing up there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 358.11,
          "end": 361.86,
          "en": "And that's exactly what Vue does behind the scenes for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 361.86,
          "end": 366.19,
          "en": "That is the core asset of frameworks like Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 366.19,
          "end": 370.82,
          "en": "You just declare, where you wanna have EventListeners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 370.82,
          "end": 373.21,
          "en": "and where you wanna output values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 373.21,
          "end": 375.91,
          "en": "and which values you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 375.91,
          "end": 378.72,
